        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "BLAKE2b algorithm with a digest size of 384, as defined in [RFC 7693](https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/rfc7693/) Section 4."
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label": [
